1
00:00:00,077 --> 00:00:02,235
5 hari sebelum lenyap...

2
00:00:02,235 --> 00:00:06,021
pilot perempuan paling terkenal
sedunia ini masih di Bandung.

3
00:00:06,021 --> 00:00:07,861
Namanya Amelia Earhart,

4
00:00:07,861 --> 00:00:09,817
sedang terbang mengelilingi bumi.

5
00:00:09,817 --> 00:00:11,946
Di Bandung pesawatnya diperbaiki...

6
00:00:11,946 --> 00:00:13,333
sempat ke Surabaya,

7
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:14,528
bermasalah lagi,

8
00:00:14,528 --> 00:00:15,520
balik lagi.

9
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:18,035
Lalu ia lenyap di atas Pasifik.

10
00:00:18,035 --> 00:00:18,998
Bulan ini,

11
00:00:18,998 --> 00:00:20,886
benda yang diduga pesawatnya...

12
00:00:20,886 --> 00:00:22,871
ternyata cuma tumpukan pohon.

13
00:00:22,871 --> 00:00:25,703
Dan salah satu surat
terakhir navigatornya...

14
00:00:25,703 --> 00:00:27,881
ditulis di sebuah hotel di Bandung.

15
00:00:27,881 --> 00:00:29,941
Kirim ke temanmu orang Bandung!
